# 行尾与文件类型规范
# 目的：让 Windows(Keil) 与 Linux/macOS 的协作者得到一致的仓库内容

# 默认：由 Git 自动判定文本文件并在仓库内统一为 LF
* text=auto

# ---- 源码与工程文件（文本，允许行尾规范化） ----
*.c            text
*.h            text
*.s            text
*.S            text
*.md           text
*.txt          text
*.ioc          text
*.mxproject    text
*.uvprojx      text
*.uvoptx       text
*.dbgconf      text
*.sct          text
*.json         text
*.yml          text
*.yaml         text

# ---- 编译产物与归档（二进制，禁止任何转换） ----
*.axf          binary
*.elf          binary
*.hex          binary
*.bin          binary
*.o            binary
*.crf          binary
*.d            binary
*.map          binary
*.dep          binary
*.lnp          binary
*.rar          binary
*.zip          binary
*.7z           binary
*.png          binary
*.jpg          binary
*.jpeg         binary
*.gif          binary
*.pdf          binary

# ---- 在 GitHub 语言统计中排除第三方库，避免掩盖本项目的真实构成 ----
Drivers/**                linguist-vendored
Middlewares/**            linguist-vendored
MDK-ARM/startup_stm32f405xx.s  linguist-vendored
